          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Khandi khulwa kano ndalareebungwakhwo nabeinzu yaIsiraeli, okhubakholela; mbu okhubameetelakhwo abandu shinga ebiayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shinga ebiayo biemisango, mbu ebiayo ebiba nibili eYerusalemu munduukho yemilukha, nolwa amataala kaleetsusibwa abandu shinga ebiayo; mana balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI. Libanda liamakumba amoomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
